#X text 240 83 the object converts a vline message into an envelope
(Env) and outputs it as an Env data type;
#X text 240 123 a vline message is a list of value-time pairs \, for
example 0 1 200 describes a ramp from value 0 to value 1 over 200 ms;
#X text 240 178 a bang outputs the envelope that was built from the
last received vline message;
#X text 240 218 the object can be used to convert vline automation
into an Env for display \, editing or saving \, for example to draw
the shape of an envelope or to store it in a preset;
